    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Adobe is a for-profit public company founded in 1982 and headquartered in San Jose, CA. Its website describes Adobe Express as an all-in-one design, photo, and video tool intended to make content creation easy, allowing users to produce social content, videos, and logos. The site also describes an AI Assistant that lets users prompt, create, and edit content while preserving chosen elements across layers.\n\nAdobe tracks several AI products across creative categories. Adobe Firefly is an image generation model the company describes as trained on commercially safe data. Adobe Express AI is a lightweight design tool that integrates Firefly for quick content creation, also described as commercially safe. Premiere Pro AI brings generative extend and color match capabilities to professional video editing, and Adobe Podcast AI offers speech enhancement and microphone check features for audio work, likewise described under a commercially safe training claim.\n\nSEC filings held for Adobe list the company under CIK 0000796343, trading on public markets under the ticker ADBE. Its most recently recorded annual revenue, reported via a 10-K for the period ending November 28, 2025, was $23,769,000,000. No litigation or MCP server records are held for the company at this time.",
